    "notice_days": "immediate",
    "serious_injury_recall": null,
    "quote": "A recall is mandatory when any model exceeds 8 thermal incidents per 100,000 installed units in a year. The manufacturer must notify the regulator and affected customers without delay, stop new sales of the model pending regulator review, and provide a remedy, including repair, replacement, or refund, as directed by the regulator."
   }
